---
title: Upgrade · app view of the flow
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> UpToDate
  UpToDate --> Available : update --check
  Available --> Checking : Review
  Checking --> Blocked : blockers
  Blocked --> Checking : Re-check
  Checking --> Ready : ready true
  Ready --> Snapshotting : Upgrade
  Snapshotting --> Applying : snapshot ok
  Snapshotting --> Failed : snapshot refused
  Applying --> RestartingDaemon : apply ok
  Applying --> Failed : step failed
  RestartingDaemon --> UpToDate : versions match
  RestartingDaemon --> Failed : version mismatch
  Failed --> RollingBack : Roll back
  RollingBack --> UpToDate : restored
  RollingBack --> Failed : partial restore
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef fail stroke-width:2px
  class Snapshotting,Applying,RestartingDaemon,RollingBack wait
  class Blocked,Failed fail
  class UpToDate live
